From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:25:02 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 41/94] arm64: dts: qcom: sdm630/sdm660: CPU DVFS, idle, GPU
 and display

- CPRh and the OSM (cpufreq-hw) with the CPU OPP tables, L2 SAW AVS,
  the fuse cells, from the stock 1.80 kernel. Node layout follows
  AngeloGioacchino Del Regno's MSM8998 CPRh/cpufreq-hw nodes.
- Energy model: dynamic-power-coefficient for both clusters.
- OSI cluster idle and the MPM system power domain.
- GPU OPPs voting CX and MX.
- MDSS: the MNOC AHB clock; the APSS watchdog.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
